# Test: the DHCP server reports a clear error and does NOT claim "started" when
# no interface binds -- the install-path silent-failure class.
# VALIDATES: startListeners zero-listener guard (dhcpserver/register.go): a bind
#            failure on every configured interface yields "no interfaces bound"
#            instead of a false "dhcpserver: started".
# PREVENTS: regression of the silent bind-failure that left the install servers
#           logging "started" while serving nothing.
#
# Mechanism: listen-interface names a device that does not exist. On Linux
# SO_BINDTODEVICE rejects the bind, so every interface fails and the zero-listener
# guard fires. Config verify only parses structure, so the config is accepted and
# the failure surfaces at the engine's bind step. INFO logging is enabled so a
# regressed "started" line would appear (and trip the reject).
#
# needs-linux: other platforms ignore the interface and bind the port globally
# (no SO_BINDTODEVICE), so the failure cannot be forced portably; the unit test
# TestStartListenersGuardsZeroBind covers the guard on every platform.
option=needs-linux

tmpfs=wait.py:mode=755:terminator=EOF_PY
#!/usr/bin/env python3
import time
# blind hold: the backgrounded ze exposes no readiness marker to poll; hold while it attempts the failing bind and logs "no interfaces bound", left un-converted (no readiness signal for a background daemon)
time.sleep(2.0)
EOF_PY

stdin=ze-dhcp:terminator=EOF_CONF
service {
    dhcp-server {
        enabled true
        listen-interface ze-no-such-iface0
        shared-network install {
            subnet 198.19.255.0/24 {
                range pool1 {
                    start 198.19.255.100
                    stop 198.19.255.200
                }
                default-router 198.19.255.1
            }
        }
    }
}
EOF_CONF

option=env:var=ze.log.dhcpserver:value=info

cmd=background:seq=1:exec=ze -:stdin=ze-dhcp
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=python3 wait.py:timeout=10s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=no interfaces bound
reject=stderr:pattern=dhcpserver: started
